    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p42-q21-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $\\alpha^3-\\alpha-24=0$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The product of roots gives $(\\alpha-1)\\alpha(\\alpha+1)=24$, so $\\alpha^3-\\alpha-24=0$.",
          "worked": "Using the product of roots,\n$$\\begin{align*}(\\alpha-1)\\alpha(\\alpha+1)&=-(-24)\\\\\\alpha(\\alpha^2-1)&=24\\\\\\alpha^3-\\alpha&=24\\\\\\alpha^3-\\alpha-24&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p42-q21-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Solve for the value of $\\alpha$ and hence find the roots.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\alpha=3$; the roots are $2,3,4$.\n\nFactor $\\alpha^3-\\alpha-24$ using the root $\\alpha=3$.",
          "worked": "Since $3^3-3-24=0$, $\\alpha-3$ is a factor.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha^3-\\alpha-24&=0\\\\(\\alpha-3)(\\alpha^2+3\\alpha+8)&=0\\end{align*}$$\nFor the quadratic factor,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=3^2-4(1)(8)\\\\\\Delta&=-23\\end{align*}$$\nThe quadratic factor has no real roots. Hence $\\alpha=3$, and the consecutive integer roots are $2,3,4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 68
      },
      {
        "id": "p42-q21-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Hence, find the value of $a$ and $b$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=-9,\\ b=26$.",
          "worked": "Using the sum of roots and the sum of roots in pairs,\n$$\\begin{align*}-a&=2+3+4\\\\-a&=9\\\\a&=-9\\\\b&=(2)(3)+(2)(4)+(3)(4)\\\\b&=26\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      }
    ]
  },
